      <VERS vnumber="3">I have put <gr str="6584">off </gr>my <gr str="3801">coat</gr>; <gr str="349">how </gr>shall I put it <gr str="3847">on</gr>? I have <gr str="7364">washed </gr>my <gr str="7272">feet</gr>; <gr str="349">how </gr>shall I <gr str="2936">defile </gr>them?</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4">My <gr str="1730">beloved </gr>
