        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11">His <gr str="7218">head </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is as</STYLE> the <gr str="3800">most </gr>fine <gr str="6337">gold</gr>, his <gr str="6977">locks </gr>
